{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-13",
  "title": "不错的回忆",
  "storyCode": "6-15",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3f190341e53656b70969105d317d007a679fc752fc4cd29ec33dd7dbc4c610aa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（煌。我需要你带队建立优势。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（你想组织一场突袭？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（我很担忧现在的情况。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（现在，我们和雪怪都依靠各自的手法确定了博士和霜星的位置。你的法术很成功，他们现在很安全。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（然而......两人的位置太接近了。只要能救出其中一个，另一个就会被一同救上来。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（有两件事情是我们现在没法确定的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（一是，会是谁先发掘出博士和霜星......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（另一个，就是霜星的态度了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（没错。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（如果是我们获得先机，我们就必须立即制服霜星，但也要用她换取雪怪小队的认同。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（这样的话，我们不仅能避免战斗，也能获得更深层的交流机会。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（如果是对方先救出领袖......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "阿、阿米娅，心跳探测仪有反应了，我们确定了精确位置，深度还不确定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哎......等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎么急急忙忙就冲出去了，啊哟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "一牵涉到博士的事，马上就变得慌慌张张，甚至会把平常的习惯丢在一旁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "真不知道该说这是阿米娅她的缺点，还是她的特长......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你想，她刚才做的那些推测，根本不像是她平常会说的话。过于快准狠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "还好，她没有走到偷袭那步。这个该我们去做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不完全是。现在偷袭雪怪小队，雪怪们一定殊死抵抗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我的目标是营救各位，而不是造成我们更大的伤亡。她没放弃最优解的那部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......看来该道歉的是我。我佣兵思维太重了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你也没直接动手不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "没有被近在眼前的战斗胜利冲昏头脑，而是坚守原本的战术目标，这才是我信任的作为战地指挥官的阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我去雪怪那儿看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "这结构......太复杂了，我有点摸不着头脑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你给我描述一下，我来作图。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "啊？我中学第八年级的教材都没念完，饶了我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你上课时候又干什么去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "训练去了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "要么你让大熊试试？他不是有那种法术吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "他是念念诗写写文章那方面的，和你这种结构探测是两回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "这样，你用算式表达试试，怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "欸，还挺不错的，我数学还行，就这样吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你有没有感觉有点热？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "不是吧，我可是穿这么厚也感觉得到大姊的源石能把我冻掉层皮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "你好啊，罗德岛的猫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好意思，我只要一流汗，周围就会变热，然后我就会继续流汗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "幸亏有你们，我感觉比平常凉快多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你很紧张吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "有一点。毕竟我没想到会和敌人共事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": ".....至少现在，可以不把我们当敌人。挖出来大姊以后，她说什么我们照办，但那是之后的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......你们和其他整合运动真的不太一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "又有几个整合运动的成员是一样的？你会觉得你和那只小兔子是一样类型的人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嚯。你说的还蛮对的，我们这儿也是什么人都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "到哪都一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "至少你们肯听我们说话，以前我们遇到的乌萨斯士兵，都是二话不说就射击的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "箭矢乒铃乓啷地射得到处都是，之后就是打起来，到一方死光了才结束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "毕竟我们不是乌萨斯士兵，是制药公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "制药公司有你们这种装备？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "现在形势比较乱，大家都得有保护自己的手段，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "......如果能把这些打来打去的时间用来种地就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "如果能多种一季红麦，就有至少半个聚落的感染者不用挨饿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "如果不是饥饿，他们也不会去那座小城，更不会被射杀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "如果，哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "别说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "他还挺多愁善感的。不，我觉得乌萨斯人都有点多愁善感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员C",
      "text": "怎么在这偷懒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。该回去干活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "没事，你们忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不过你身上带着的那个，香味真足啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "啊？这......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员C",
      "text": "她在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "没事，没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哎，有点馋啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员C",
      "text": "哦......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "你，你看我干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "15:22 P.M.\n切尔诺伯格分城“14区”废墟\n区块地面\n挖掘作业三小时后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "阿米娅，收手吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "你的手指已经血流不止了......！别再用手挖了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "可我......我感受到情感了，就在这下面......就在这下面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "用工具的话，我感受不到......我必须用手指才摸得到那种细小的感觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "阿米娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "已经很近了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（陨星......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "（可是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（让她去吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "如果让他们先找到的话......如果让他们先找到的话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "没事，你能行的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "要用法术？我，我不行啊，这个我真不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "除了大姊我们就没人会这种类型的法术了啊？快点快点，只要把这两边的温度变得不一样就行，差距越大越好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "我就试试......失败了可别怪我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "除了怪你，还能怪谁啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员C",
      "text": "别折腾他了，让他集中精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "就是这里，就是这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......墙体？我挖错了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "对，只要打碎它，打碎它......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "可这里坍塌的话......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我......挖错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
      "text": "打开了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "煌！陨星！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "做好准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你赢了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我会输吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你没有给我能赢的选项。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "大姊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "......这个人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "这个人就是罗德岛所说的博士吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "要杀要剐悉听尊便！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你好。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "罗德岛的领袖。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "是我。可以叫我阿米娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "（她的戒指......戒指在变红？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "（你不阻止她？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "（我没有理由阻止我们唯一的胜机。）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "煌！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我尊重阿米娅的选择。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅，不。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "大熊，罗德岛是不是没有和你们交战？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大熊",
          "text": "没有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......那么在这片战场上，我们就不是敌人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "霜星......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不是敌人就没有理由厮杀了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "请回吧，博士。回到你的队伍里去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "......不愧是大姊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
          "text": "需要你夸吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "安静些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "小兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "呃，我叫阿米娅......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你们也要前往龙门，对吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......没错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "那我们迟早会是敌人，小兔子。只是，现在还不是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "霜星，你和你的小队并不像其他整合运动一样嗜杀、混乱。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "别指责我的同胞。你并不清楚他们经历过什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "可你也不愿意看着他们这样下去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......哦？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你似乎能看穿我的想法？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我不能。但我能隐约感受到你的不安和局促。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "这些都将在龙门陷落后一扫而空。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "罗德岛其实......能够理解你和你的小队。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "也许你会反驳，会认为我根本不理解你们......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "但霜星小姐，他们经历过什么，我清清楚楚。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......幼稚。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星，你身上的衣服，不是你的吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "没错。这曾经是“爱国者”的斗篷。我把它改织成了外衣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你是怎么看出来的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "算了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "每个人都会有自己说不出来的事情吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "霜星小姐，罗德岛不想和任何人发生不必要的冲突。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "又有哪种发生了的冲突是必要的呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "至少我们不想与你的小队作战！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "他们都是正直善良的人。伤害他们，或者让他们伤害无辜的人，绝对违背了我们的意愿！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......那就祈祷我们别再见面吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "霜星小姐！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我可能也没那么想伤害各位。但如果必要的话，我会把各位全都杀掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你可以来罗德岛。我们可以不再互相战斗。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "那你可以试着打赢我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "如果你战胜了我，我可以考虑一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "只不过，我们只要在战场上相见，那就会是敌人。身为敌人，就是会互相残杀，不死不休。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "对了，这个，给那只小狐狸。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "......什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "治疗冻伤的特效药。独家秘方。至少能缓解烧灼感和疼痛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我研究这东西很久了，刚才那一仗，你打的很不错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "舍己为人的战士，在我眼里是最强的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "霜星......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "啊，等等，那我也有要说的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "雪怪1号！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "啊......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "怎么回事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "下次一起喝点！伏特加真够香的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1号",
          "text": "别说出来啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "唔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "哈哈......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "再见，罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "希望我们不会再见面。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "龙门下层结构"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你果然会在这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好，霜星。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你们好，罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
